        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Springlatch for PDQ SV & SD Series</b>\r\n<p>For use with <a href=\"/products/commercial-door-knobs-grade-2-pdq-sv-series\"><b>PDQ SV Series Commercial Door Knobs</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/commercial-door-levers-standard-duty-grade-2-pdq-sd-series\"><b>PDQ SD Series Commercial Door Levers</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSpringlatches are used on <b>Non-Keyed Functions</b> (does NOT uses a key to unlock the door knob/lever) including Passage and Privacy functions. Available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: For keyed functions use  <a href=\"/products/pdq-sv-and-sd-series-deadlatch\"><b>PDQ Deadlatch</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI A156.2, Series 4000, Grade 2. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of \u001cA\u001d  label (3 hours) and less, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4\u0019'0\"\u001d x 8'\u00190\"\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually.\r\n</p>",
